tags: movement

= The Defence Committee

In [+ e22_cm_name +] the committee formed in June still meets on Tuesday evenings in the back room of the trade union house: two Social Democrats, an Independent, the union secretary and our district man. The monarchist league in the town has stopped holding its parades. The committee wonders what it is for now.

- @standing: Make it a standing body of the works councils.
- @strike: Use it to call a strike against the leagues.

@standing
subtitle: The district trusts us more, and so does the SPD there.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.e22_cm_d, {loyalty: 8, members: 0.04});
Q.spd_relation += 4;
!}

The committee is enlarged to the works councils of the town and meets every week. When a Social Democrat proposes our man as its chairman, nobody objects.

@strike
subtitle: A strike in [+ e22_cm_name +], with the Social Democrats beside us at first.
on-arrival: {!
RG.startStrike(Q.e22_cm_d);
RG.district(Q.e22_cm_d, {militancy: 6});
Q.spd_relation -= 2;
!}

The committee calls a one-day strike against the leagues. It lasts three days, and on the third the Social Democrats go back to work.
